column78:
Another fun thing to do is use an empty entry, like<p><pre><code>  mv .xinitrc{,.bak}
</code></pre>
or, if you have some stuff mounted under another mountpoint, such as when installing gentoo:<p><pre><code>  umount /mnt/gentoo/{proc,dev,boot,}
</code></pre>
That empty entry expands to the base path, which can be a nice shortcut.
